---
description: Shared game logic lives in core/; sync into mobile after edits.
globs: core/**,mobile/src/core/**,mobile/src/game/**
alwaysApply: false
---

# Core is the source of truth

- Edit game rules in `core/`, not `mobile/src/core/` (generated).
- After changing `core/`, run `npm test` in `core/`, then `npm run sync-core` in `mobile/`.
- Keep core files free of DOM and React Native.
- Immutable updates in `mobile/src/game/` (spread, map, filter). Keep files under about 400 lines.
